# Pyre Rhymer has prowess and enters prepared (CR 722.3a), a copy of Molten Tide waiting in exile. Turn 7 Bot1 casts that
# copy, an instant: prowess makes the Rhymer 4/4 (its trigger resolves first, then Molten Tide). "Until end of turn, whenever you tap a Mountain for mana, add an
# additional {R}": a delayed triggered mana ability (CR 603.7b, 605.1b) that resolves at once with the tap (CR 605.4a), the
# stack empty. Volcanic Island, an Island Mountain, tapped for {U} adds the additional {R} too; an Island adds nothing more.
# "You" is Molten Tide's controller (CR 603.7d): Bot2 tapping its own Mountain in Bot1's end step gets {R} alone. It ends
# with the turn: on turn 9 a Mountain makes {R} alone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Pyre Rhymer
Mountain
Mountain
Volcanic Island
Island
Mountain x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#3.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pyre Rhymer.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Pyre Rhymer.Prepared = true
? Exile = Molten Tide
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Volcanic Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot1.Exile.Molten Tide.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Pyre Rhymer.Prepared = (absent)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Pyre Rhymer.Power = 4
? Bot1.Mana = {R}{R}
? Bot1.ManaFrom = {R} Molten Tide; {R} Mountain
Bot1.Battlefield.Volcanic Island.Activate(Ability: {U})
? Bot1.Mana = {U}{R}{R}{R}
[T7 Bot1.End]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
? Bot2.Mana = {R}
[T9 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#3.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {R}

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Pyre Rhymer.Power = 3
